            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "message": "The <b>Featured image<\/b> and the default media upload sizes will produce cropped versions of the image.<br>\r\nThe <b>Work<\/b> will use these versions at 3 specific breakpoints:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>- Mobile<\/li>\r\n<li>- Tablet<\/li>\r\n<li>- Desktop<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<br>\r\nThe <b>Lastest Works<\/b> will use the <b>Featured image<\/b>.<br>\r\nThe Menu's Works hover functionality will use the <b>Featured image<\/b>.",
            "new_lines": "",
            "esc_html": 0
        },
