            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "message": "Please choose images for the <b>Mobile<\/b>, <b>Tablet<\/b>, and <b>Desktop<\/b> breakpoints. The Featured image will not be used for the Work's hero image when <b>Manual<\/b> is selected, but it must still be uploaded as it is used in the Menu's Works hover functionality.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe <b>Latest Works<\/b> images can be uploaded here at all breakpoints for specific cropping needs.",
